    description: "kserve: V2 routes (prefix=/v2), V1 routes (prefix from constant), and OpenAI routes (prefix from env var) are all invisible because APIRouter(prefix=X) + add_api_route(/path) does not compose X+/path. All 3 kserve instances use imported constants, not literals, so simple literal detection will not help. Requires constant propagation or import tracing. See spec §20 Future Work."  # 496e
